===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|odt|nl}} {{term/t|odt|*graf}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|nl}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*grabą}}.

====Pronunciation====
{{rfc-level|check placement of Pronunciation|lang=nl}}
