* {{audio|Nl-graf.ogg|audio}}

====Noun====
{{nl-noun|n|-:ven|grafje}}

# [[grave]]

=====Derived terms=====
* [[grafsteen]]

===Etymology 2===
From {{etyl|fr|nl}} {{term|grave||serious, grave|lang=fr}}. Most likely influenced by Dutch {{term|erg|||lang=nl}} which can mean "serious, grave" as well as "very". The alternative form {{term|graaf||very||lang=nl}}, also slang, has the same origin and meaning, but stays closer to the original French pronounciation.

====Adverb====
{{nl-adv}}

# {{context|slang|lang=nl}} [[very]]
#: ''Dat is graf duur'' &mdash; That's very expensive

